  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "blk-0161",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 1,
      "text": "第六章 数码产品设计实例（打印机/投影仪）（⭐⭐⭐ 考综合）",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0162",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "【核心逻辑】数码产品设计不是“拍脑袋长出来的”，而是由CMF、人机、结构、语义 共同推导 出来的。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0163",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "一、CMF驱动分件 + 美工线",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0164",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "CMF  = Color（色彩）+ Material（材料）+ Finishing（工艺）。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0165",
      "type": "quote",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "什么叫“分件”？",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0166",
      "type": "quote",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "一台打印机，前面板是 白色亮面塑料 ，侧盖是 灰色磨砂塑料 ，操作面板是 黑色钢琴烤漆 ——三种不同颜色/材料的零件，不可能长成一个整体，所以必须分开建模。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0167",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "分件之间的那条缝，叫“美工线”  （也叫分件槽）：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0168",
      "type": "table",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        "概念",
        "是什么",
        "怎么建模"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "美工线",
          "主动设计的凹槽，用来区分不同材质/颜色的零件",
          "建模时在零件交界处做一条0.5-1mm宽的凹槽"
        ],
        [
          "分模线",
          "工艺残留，模具开模留下的痕迹",
          "建模时尽量隐藏或做小，实在不行用0.1-0.2mm凸起"
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0169",
      "type": "quote",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "考试重点 ：美工线是 主动设计的装饰 ，分模线是 被动留下的痕迹 。前者是美学，后者是工艺。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0170",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "举个例子 ：iPhone 4的不锈钢中框和前后玻璃面板之间那条细细的缝隙，就是美工线——它在告诉你“这里是金属和玻璃的交界处”。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0171",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "二、人机交互面布局",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0172",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "屏幕和按键必须在 用户的正面视野内 + 手指自然可及的区域 。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0173",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "打印机例子 ：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0174",
      "type": "quote",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "- 控制面板一定在 打印机前方偏上 ——用户站着操作，屏幕刚好在视线水平",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0175",
      "type": "quote",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "- 按键间距不小于 8mm ——防止手指粗的人误触",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0176",
      "type": "quote",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "- USB接口在前方或侧面伸手可及处——不用钻到机器后面去插",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0177",
      "type": "quote",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0178",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "这叫“结构合理性”——每一个特征的位置，都是有依据的，不是随便放的。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0179",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "三、功能特征形态化",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0180",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "散热孔、镜头、接口这些功能件， 不要当“补丁”一样贴上去 ，要让它们成为设计语言的一部分。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0181",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "投影仪例子 ：",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0182",
      "type": "quote",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "-  镜头  = 视觉中心，是“眼睛”，必须突出，周围做同心圆环装饰",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0183",
      "type": "quote",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "-  散热格栅  = 设计成动感线条，从侧面延伸到后面，像跑车的进气口",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0184",
      "type": "quote",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "-  指示灯  = 镶嵌在美工线里，不额外开孔",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0185",
      "type": "quote",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0186",
      "type": "quote",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "答题模板 ：“该投影仪将散热孔设计为参数化渐变的斜向格栅，既满足空气对流需求，同时通过阵列元素形成速度感的视觉符号，实现了功能与形态的融合。”",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0187",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "四、形态语义",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0188",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "产品造型会“说话”——用户看到形状就能猜到它的性格。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0189",
      "type": "table",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        "造型倾向",
        "语义（用户感觉）",
        "适用产品"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "前倾、有棱角",
          "主动、高效、专业",
          "办公打印机、游戏设备"
        ],
        [
          "圆润、曲线多",
          "亲和、家居、安全",
          "家用电器、儿童产品"
        ],
        [
          "极简、方正",
          "现代、科技、冷静",
          "苹果风格产品"
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0190",
      "type": "quote",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "举个例子 ：戴森风扇那个“无叶”圆环造型 → 语义是“未来感、黑科技”；小米空气净化器那个圆润柱体 → 语义是“简约、家居百搭”。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0191",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "五、场景化渲染",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0192",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "渲染不是把产品“立正站好”拍个白底图就完了，而是 把产品放在它的使用环境里 。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0193",
      "type": "quote",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "� 投影仪  → 必须在 暗环境 下渲染，加上 体积光（光锥效果）  ，屏幕投射出画面。这样一眼就能看出“这是个投影仪”。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0194",
      "type": "quote",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0195",
      "type": "quote",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "如果放在亮堂堂的摄影棚里，投影仪跟个黑色方盒子没区别，谁也不知道它是干嘛的。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0196",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "六、环境光遮蔽（AO）",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0197",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "AO  = Ambient Occlusion（环境光遮蔽）。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0198",
      "type": "quote",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "什么效果？  让模型缝隙、转角、零件交界处有自然的阴影，看着更“扎实”、更有体积感。没有AO的效果是“飘”在画面上的。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0199",
      "type": "quote",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0200",
      "type": "quote",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "KeyShot里直接勾选开启就行，不用调参数。",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0201",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "答题模板 ：“在产品渲染中开启 环境光遮蔽（AO）通道 ，能够增强模型转折面的立体感，使形体关系更加清晰，视觉上更加真实、厚重。”",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0202",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "text": "七、打印机实例建模常用命令",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        ""
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          ""
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0203",
      "type": "table",
      "level": 0,
      "text": "",
      "label": "",
      "marker": "",
      "ordered": false,
      "headers": [
        "命令",
        "适用场景"
      ],
      "rows": [
        [
          "放样（Loft）",
          "打印机主体曲面（有机形态的机身）"
        ],
        [
          "布尔差集",
          "屏幕凹槽、散热孔、接口开孔"
        ],
        [
          "投影（Project）",
          "在曲面上精确定位Logo、指示灯位置"
        ],
        [
          "挤出（Extrude）",
          "出纸托盘、进纸槽"
        ]
      ],
      "depth": 0
    },
    {
      "id": "blk-0204",
      "type": "paragraph",
      "level": 0,
